---
interface Props{kind:'loop'|'context'|'evaluation'}
const {kind}=Astro.props,id='agent-'+kind;
const titles={loop:'The next action depends on the last observation.',context:'Stored information must reach the next decision.',evaluation:'Check both the outcome and the trajectory.'};
const captions={loop:'Figure 1. A model proposes an action using the current context. Application checks control execution. Tool observations update state before the next decision. A final answer or clarification is checked as a stopping proposal.',context:'Figure 2. Application state and relevant stored information are selected into a bounded context. The current goal and its constraints stay visible. Saving an observation is not enough if the next decision never receives it.',evaluation:'Figure 3. Evaluate complete test tasks and inspect their traces. A supported answer, an authorized route, and reasonable resource use are separate checks. Use failures to improve the system, then rerun held-out cases.'};
const rows=kind==='loop'?[['Current context','Goal + observations'],['Model decision','Tool / ask / finish'],['Application gate','Scope + constraints'],['Tool execution','Return observation']]:kind==='evaluation'?[['Test tasks','Normal + edge cases'],['Agent runs','Keep trajectories'],['Outcome checks','Evidence + constraints'],['Route checks','Scope + calls + stops']]:[];
---
<figure class="diagram"><div class="figure-title"><span class="figure-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>{titles[kind]}</div><div class="diagram-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={titles[kind]}><svg viewBox="0 0 760 275" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-title ${id}-desc`}><title id={`${id}-title`}>{titles[kind]}</title><desc id={`${id}-desc`}>{captions[kind]}</desc><defs><marker id={`${id}-arrow`} markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8Z" fill="var(--accent)"/></marker></defs>
{rows.map(([title,sub],i)=><g><rect x={20+i*187} y="48" width="158" height="86" rx="8" fill={i===2?'var(--accent-soft)':'var(--panel)'} stroke="var(--line)"/><text x={99+i*187} y="82" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="15">{title}</text><text x={99+i*187} y="108" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="12.5">{sub}</text>{i<3&&<path d={`M${183+i*187} 91 H${201+i*187}`} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={`url(#${id}-arrow)`}/>}</g>)}
{kind==='loop'&&<><path d="M473 142 V155" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={`url(#${id}-arrow)`}/><text x="473" y="177" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Finish / ask / stop</text><path d="M660 142 V222 H99 V148" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={`url(#${id}-arrow)`}/><text x="375" y="205" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="14">Record the result; update the context</text><text x="380" y="258" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Example: M001 unavailable → next check targets M003</text></>}
{kind==='evaluation'&&<><path d="M660 142 V212 H99 V148" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end={`url(#${id}-arrow)`}/><text x="380" y="193" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="14">Locate failures → improve → rerun evaluation</text><text x="380" y="252" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">A plausible answer alone cannot establish a reliable run.</text></>}
{kind==='context'&&<><rect x="20" y="22" width="209" height="85" rx="8" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="124.5" y="53" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="16">Current state</text><text x="124.5" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Goal, checks, budgets</text><rect x="20" y="162" width="209" height="80" rx="8" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="124.5" y="194" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="16">Relevant memory</text><text x="124.5" y="219" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Preferences + sources</text><rect x="309" y="92" width="177" height="85" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="397.5" y="125" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="16">Select context</text><text x="397.5" y="151" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Keep critical evidence</text><path d="M237 64 H270 V115 H298" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={`url(#${id}-arrow)`}/><path d="M237 202 H270 V155 H298" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={`url(#${id}-arrow)`}/><path d="M494 134 H561" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={`url(#${id}-arrow)`}/><rect x="574" y="92" width="163" height="85" rx="8" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="655.5" y="125" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)" font-size="16">Next decision</text><text x="655.5" y="151" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Model uses context</text><text x="503" y="242" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="13">Context changes; model weights can stay fixed.</text></>}
</svg></div><figcaption>{captions[kind]}</figcaption></figure>
